# USOTest3VM's base (playbook §3): the plain server - no VMs, btrfs cache + a ZFS pool «fast» (the second pool, 2026-10-19),
# Docker on with the demo apps since 2026-10-19 (SV-DOCKER-OFF is a state: docker_off), Unraid's mover on schedule,
# the time zone broken on purpose (TM-UTC-BROKEN: the Zurich zone file is missing on 7.3/7.4, the server runs UTC).
HOST_IP=192.168.7.197
DOCKER=yes
HIRE="advisor backup cleanup logs moverelli restore snapshot watchman"
BACKUP_PRESET=auto
BACKUP_CRON="30 4 * * *"
# Ms. Moverelli hired but not set up: her setup turns Unraid's mover off (only with the page's consent), and this
# base keeps Unraid's mover on schedule - the base difference the `needs test3` scenarios use
MOVERELLI_X=
MOVERELLI_CRON=
MOVERELLI_RULES=
DRILL=weekly
MOVER_SCHEDULE="40 3 * * *"
LOCALTIME=/usr/share/zoneinfo/Europe/Zurich
CARRY=""
